WEBVTT

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.680
It's on!

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:41.170
I'll show you the real power
of Dranzer Gigus Turbo!

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.080
The likes of which
you've never seen!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.120
Turbo Engine, full power!!

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.810
Go, Dranzer!!

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.620
Go Dragoon!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.930
That's Kinomiya for you...

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:38.530
That's the man that makes me
throw everything I've got at you!

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:45.530
However... I've got still got another
move hidden up my sleeve!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:53.150
Go!! This is the real power
of Dranzer Gigus Turbo!

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:00.860
What the--!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.570
What?!

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.570
What's this...?

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.910
What the heck's
goin' on out there?!

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.570
Drazner's Engine Gear
is spinning in reverse.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.800
I've never seen a
Bey do that before!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:42.440
The wind calmed down...

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:35.150
Why you...!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:44.310
Stopped ya in your tracks!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.370
Fine by me!

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:51.420
A-awesome!
Keep it up, Takao!

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:56.080
But if he continues to go up
against that reverse rotation,

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.210
Dragoon's Engine Gear will...!

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.460
I'm counting on you, Dragoon!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:07.060
Just hang in there
for a little longer!

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:10.970
Not yet!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:16.330
Kyoujyu fixed my Dragoon, so there's no
way it'll break under something like this!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.220
Go, Dragoon!!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:25.860
It's no use! Dranzer!!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.770
--Takao!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.260
You can still stand, huh?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:01.280
Unbelievable! The final match has all but defied logic, and yet we still don't have a winner!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:21.100
Even so, their expressions suggest
that they intend to continue the battle!

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.510
You can't!
It's dangerous to keep going!

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:28.710
The two of you have
fought enough, haven't you?

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:33.370
Do you intend to fight
until one of you dies?!

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.640
Takao... Kai...

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.090
What about the championships?

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:44.730
This is astounding, however...

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:51.170
I initially held this tournament as tag battles because I wanted to encourage the growth of all Bladers.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:58.510
By learning to work hard with their partners, and sharing their joy and sadness together.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:07.400
It is clear to see that their growth has
gone far beyond my expectations.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:12.730
Even so, Kai has single-handedly managed to overturn all of that.

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:17.710
With his formidable strength
and fearsome tenacity.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:25.880
And Takao's growth, along with the deep bond
he shares with his team, took it head-on.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:29.550
The two of them are
so passionate! So intense!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:33.820
If they have already surpassed
our expectations this much,

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:39.310
then it is possible that they have
already gone far beyond our imagination.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:45.680
If they have gone so far for the sake of
Beyblade, then I want to let them continue.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.950
Until the both of them are
satisfied. That being said...

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:57.620
As the commissioner of the tournament,
I must make the difficult decisions!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.940
I hope you both understand...

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:04.680
Ladies and gentlemen,
as you can plainly see,

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:10.730
it wouldn't be far-fetched to say that this battle has surpassed human limitations.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:14.780
I have nothing but the greatest
complements to these two Bladers

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.840
who have shown us
such a fantastic battle.

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.920
However, if the battle were
to continue any further,

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:27.250
it is possible that their lives as Bladers could come to an end.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:37.280
As such, I recognize both the BBA Revolution and Neo-Borg as this tournament's winners.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.460
...rew that...

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.460
Screw that!!

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:50.060
What what were
fighting for all this time?!

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:54.920
Why did we sacrifice
everything for Beyblade?!

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.930
H-however...

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:00.860
I didn't come to fight this battle
for your entertainment!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:05.040
A winner? If that's what
you want, you can have it!

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.420
All I want...

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:12.370
Is to finish my battle
with you, Takao Kinomiya!

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.260
Kai...

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:18.770
I won't allow
a draw in our battle!

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.660
Don't you agree, Kinomiya?

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:25.000
You bet. I know!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:32.000
Daitenji! Let us continue
the match! Please!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:36.970
Our Beyspirits are
still burning strong!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.530
Even so, your bodies are...

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.860
I'll ask you, too!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.510
Please let the two
of them continue!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.460
Same here!

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.170
They'll be fine! Takao and Kai
have a lot more fight left in them!

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:55.840
Yeah! They said they'd be fine,
so hurry up and let 'em play!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:57.440
--Chairman!
--Please!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.440
Chairman!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.840
--Chairman Daitenji!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.350
Chairman...

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:18.860
I suppose I don't have the
right to stop them after all...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:23.540
I will leave the decision to the ladies and gentlemen of the audience!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.880
F-Fine then!
I'll prepare myself for the worst!

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:36.480
Since we've already come this far,
I'll see your battle to the very end!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.260
Aw, whatever!
Go, both of you!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:41.820
Awright!
Get ready, everyone!

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:46.710
Three! Two! One!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.080
Go, Shoot!

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:58.920
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.260
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:04.970
Dranzer!!

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.750
Here we go!!

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.350
You're a tough nut to crack.

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:05.730
But even so!

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:10.340
Blazing Gig Tempest!!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.090
Galaxy Turbo Twister!!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.680
What?!

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:34.170
Zan!

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:03.330
Even after that clash,
the both of them still...

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:07.400
What is this burning passion
I can feel welling up...?

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.620
That's the way!
Keep going!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.970
I can feel it, Kai!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:58.150
With each and every strike, I can feel what you put into your Bey! Into this battle!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:15:59.970
Kinomiya...

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:12.200
From here on out
it's just you and me.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.200
Let's go in with
everything we've got!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.770
Yeah. Just what I've
been waiting for.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.480
Both of us wanna win.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.930
Neither of us
wants to lose.

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:30.970
But in this tournament
I finally understand.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:34.480
Rei, Max, and you too, Kai...

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.970
When I thought you all abandoned
me, all I thought about...

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:41.960
Was how I was the champ,
and lost sight of myself.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:45.410
I lost horribly
and was frustrated.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.250
But now, it's different!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:50.730
It's not all about
winning and losing!

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:59.910
Kai, I love moments like this when I fight you head-on without a thought in my mind!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.790
That's why
I love Beyblading!

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.300
That's why
Beyblading my passion!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:08.880
Kinomiya...
I feel the same way.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:17.750
If this moment...
If this one moment continues forever...

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.860
Then I'll... I'll...

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:26.640
But sometimes you just
have to draw the line.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:29.980
Yeah.
Let's get started then.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.920
Attack with
everything I've got!

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:43.310
Burn into a blaze, Dranzer!!

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.930
Go, Dragoon!!

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:11.170
W-what's going on?!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:40.770
But I want you to
remember this, Kai.

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:44.880
I've been fighting with the feelings of Daichi, Kyoujyu, Rei and Max...

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:49.380
And with all of the rivals
I've fought up to now too.

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:57.570
You've been chasing after me all this time,
so remember that I know how you feel too.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.600
It's over!!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.100
The winners of the Beyblade world championship tag-battle are...

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:37.530
Takao Kinomiya and Daichi Sumeragi
of the BBA Revolution!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.200
I won...

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:44.600
We did it! We did it!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.460
Me and Takao! We won!
We're number one!

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:48.950
Please, wait for me!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.690
Now I get it...
Seeking strong rivals...

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:12.300
And loving Beyblade from
the bottom of his heart...

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:14.340
Is what gives
Takao his strength.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:19.640
A Beyblade gains and loses its
strength based on the Blader's will.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:23.580
Because he had the feelings of
his friends and rivals with him...

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:26.370
Takao was able to
barely surpass Kai...

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.750
Even so, I...

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:42.800
I know it, Kai...

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:46.180
This isn't the end
of our battle.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:52.290
I'll be waiting for the day you get
stronger and challenge me again.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:59.860
I wanted to use Kai, but looks like Kai ended up using me to fight Kinomiya.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.710
But now...

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:33.450
As long as we have these awesome rivals, our battles will continue!

00:22:55.730 --> 00:22:57.360
Tch, gimme a break!

00:22:57.360 --> 00:23:01.780
Even though I became the world champ, it's all about Takao-this and Takao-that!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:04.620
Takao isn't the only
one who won, dangit!

00:23:04.620 --> 00:23:10.100
So I decided that in order to really be number one, I gotta beat you, Takao!

00:23:10.100 --> 00:23:12.850
And I'm not coming back
home until I do it!

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:16.180
Every man has a time when he
needs to go out on an adventure!

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.060
Bye, Takao!
Bye, Gramps!

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:22.100
See ya! Y'all better
see me off too!
